      "path": "/books/al-kafi:8:1:43:54",
      "text": [
        " كُنَّا مَعَ أَمِيرِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ (عليه السلام) فَاضْطَرَبَتِ الْأَرْضُ فَوَحَاهَا بِيَدِهِ ثُمَّ قَالَ لَهَا اسْكُنِي مَا لَكِ ثُمَّ الْتَفَتَ إِلَيْنَا وَ قَالَ أَمَا إِنَّهَا لَوْ كَانَتِ الَّتِي قَالَ اللَّهُ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ لَأَجَابَتْنِي وَ لَكِنْ لَيْسَتْ بِتِلْكَ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "<a id=\"_Toc492473495\">H 14814</a> – From him, from Salih, from Muhammad Bin Sinan, from Ibn Muskaan, from Abu Bakr Al-Hazramy, from Tameem Bin Haatim who said:",
          "<span class=\"first-chapter-phrase\"><span class=\"first-in-chapter character-w\">W</span>e were with Amir-ul</span>-Momineen<sup>asws</sup>, so the earth became restless (tremor). So he<sup>asws</sup> gestured with his<sup>asws</sup> hand, then said to it: ‘Calm down! What is the matter with you?’ Then he<sup>asws</sup> turned towards us and said: ‘But, had it been that (quake<a id=\"_ftnref26\"></a><sup>[26]</sup>) which Allah<sup>azwj</sup> Mighty and Majestic has Said, it would have answered me<sup>asws</sup>, but it is not that one’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "367. From him, from Salih, from Muhammad Bin Sinan, from Ibn Muskaan, from Abu Bakr Al-Hazramy, from Tameem Bin Haatim who said: We were with Amir-ul-Momineen (a.s.), so the earth became restless (tremor). So he (a.s.) gestured with his (a.s.) hand, then said to it: ‘Calm down! What is the matter with you?’ Then he (a.s.) turned towards us and said: ‘But, had it been that (quake) which Allah (azwj) Mighty and Majestic has Said, it would have answered me (a.s.), but it is not that one’."
        ]
      }
